# The To do notes of private repos. This repo is public, so these notes never go to
# GitHub: they live in this checkout and the Obsidian vault only (CLAUDE.md, "Private
# To do notes"). Never `git add -f` them. List every private ChadFarrow repo here, two
# lines each (its note, and a second note "<repo> <anything>.md"), even before it has a
# note. A repo that turns private: add it here, then `git rm --cached` its notes.
